      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The ground hosted England’s first day‑night Test match in 2017, when the national team faced the West Indies under floodlights.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgbaston_Cricket_Ground",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1997, Edgbaston staged England’s first senior game under floodlights, a Sunday League clash between Warwickshire and Somerset.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgbaston_Cricket_Ground",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The V & L Visitor & Learning Centre, opened in 2011, offers interactive displays charting Warwickshire’s cricket history and test match moments.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgbaston_Cricket_Ground",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Edgbaston was the venue for the 2019 ICC Cricket World Cup final, where England won its first World Cup title.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
